# 📊 Data Transformation Mapping Sheet (Bronze ➡️ Silver)

This document provides a detailed mapping of all data cleaning, standardization, and enrichment transformations applied during the **ELT pipeline** transition from the raw **Bronze Layer** to the refined **Silver Layer**.

---

## 🛠 Transformation Summary Matrix

| Source Table (Bronze) | Target Column (Silver) | Transformation Rule / Expression | Business & Data Quality Reason |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **olist_customers** | `customer_id`<br>`customer_unique_id`<br>`customer_zip_code_prefix` | `TRIM()` | Removes leading/trailing spaces for primary keys and join integrity. |
| | `customer_city` | `LOWER(TRIM())` | Standardizes city names to lowercase to merge variations caused by casing. |
| | `customer_state` | `UPPER(TRIM())` | Standardizes state codes to uppercase (e.g., `sp`, `rj` ➡️ `SP`, `RJ`). |
| **olist_geolocation** | `geolocation_city` | `LOWER(TRIM())` | Standardizes city names for reliable spatial joins. |
| | `geolocation_state` | `UPPER(TRIM())` | Standardizes state codes to uppercase. |
| **olist_order_items** | `order_id`<br>`product_id`<br>`seller_id` | `TRIM()` | Cleans whitespace to guarantee Foreign Key integrity. |
| **olist_order_payments** | `payment_type` | `LOWER(TRIM())` | Standardizes payment method names (e.g., `credit_card`). |
| **olist_order_reviews** | `review_id`<br>`order_id` | `TRIM()` | Cleans whitespace for key identifiers. |
| | `review_comment_title`<br>`review_comment_message` | `CASE WHEN TRIM(...) IS NULL OR '' THEN 'n/a' ELSE TRIM(...) END` | Replaces empty string/NULL reviews with `'n/a'` to prevent issues in text querying. |
| **olist_orders** | `order_id`<br>`customer_id` | `TRIM()` | Standardizes key identifiers. |
| | `order_status` | `LOWER(TRIM())` | Standardizes status values (e.g., `delivered`, `shipped`). |
| | `is_valid_timeline` | `CASE WHEN` *(Derived Flag)* | Data quality check ensuring order milestone dates follow a valid chronological sequence. |
| | `is_late_delivery` | `CASE WHEN` *(Derived Flag)* | Flag specifying delivery delay: `1` (Late), `0` (On-time), `NULL` (Pending/Not delivered). |
| | `actual_delivery_days` | `DATEDIFF(day, purchase, delivered)` | Measures true fulfillment cycle time (days). |
| | `estimated_delivery_days` | `DATEDIFF(day, purchase, estimated)` | Measures expected fulfillment duration (days). |
| **olist_products** | `product_id` | `TRIM()` | Standardizes product identifiers. |
| | `product_category_name` | `COALESCE(NULLIF(TRIM(...), ''), 'n/a')` | Fills missing/blank categories with default `'n/a'`. |
| | `product_name_length`<br>`product_description_length`<br>`product_photos_qty` | `COALESCE(..., 0)` | Replaces missing numeric values (`NULL`) with `0` for aggregated calculations. |
| | `product_weight_g`<br>`product_length_cm`<br>`product_height_cm`<br>`product_width_cm` | `CASE WHEN ... > 0 THEN ... ELSE NULL END` | Filters out non-positive or corrupted measurements by converting them to `NULL`. |
| | `product_volume_cm3` | `CAST(length AS BIGINT) * width * height` | Computes package physical volume in $cm^3$ for items with valid dimensions. |
| | `product_weight_kg` | `CAST(weight_g AS DECIMAL(10,3)) / 1000.0` | Converts unit measurement from grams to kilograms for downstream reporting. |
| | `has_valid_dimensions` | `CASE WHEN ... > 0 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END` | Data completeness flag for dimension/weight metrics. |
| **olist_sellers** | `seller_id`<br>`seller_zip_code_prefix` | `TRIM()` | Cleans whitespace on seller attributes. |
| | `seller_city` | `CASE WHEN TRY_CAST IS NOT NULL THEN 'n/a' ... ELSE LOWER(TRIM()) END` | Fixes corrupted numeric data in city names by defaulting them to `'n/a'`. |
| | `seller_state` | `UPPER(TRIM())` | Standardizes state codes to uppercase. |
| **product_category_name_translation** | `product_category_name`<br>`product_category_name_translation` | `TRIM()` | Standardizes string values for precise category joins and translation. |

